sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Member (client)
    participant C as WithdrawalController
    participant S as WithdrawalService
    participant WR as WithdrawalRequestRepository
    participant AR as ApprovalRepository
    participant GR as GroupRepository

    M->>C: POST /api/withdrawals
    C->>S: createWithdrawal(request)
    S->>WR: save(status=PENDING)
    WR-->>S: WithdrawalRequest(id)
    S-->>C: WithdrawalRequest
    C-->>M: 200 OK, status=PENDING

    M->>C: POST /api/withdrawals/{id}/approvals (Official A, APPROVE)
    C->>S: submitApproval(id, request)
    S->>AR: findByWithdrawalRequestIdAndMemberId
    AR-->>S: none found
    S->>AR: save(Approval A)
    S->>AR: findByWithdrawalRequestId(id)
    AR-->>S: [Approval A]
    S->>GR: findById(groupId)
    GR-->>S: Group(approvalThreshold=2)
    Note over S: approveCount (1) < threshold (2)
    S-->>C: WithdrawalRequest(status=PENDING)
    C-->>M: 200 OK, status=PENDING

    M->>C: POST /api/withdrawals/{id}/approvals (Official B, APPROVE)
    C->>S: submitApproval(id, request)
    S->>AR: findByWithdrawalRequestIdAndMemberId
    AR-->>S: none found
    S->>AR: save(Approval B)
    S->>AR: findByWithdrawalRequestId(id)
    AR-->>S: [Approval A, Approval B]
    S->>GR: findById(groupId)
    GR-->>S: Group(approvalThreshold=2)
    Note over S: approveCount (2) >= threshold (2)
    S->>WR: save(status=APPROVED)
    S-->>C: WithdrawalRequest(status=APPROVED)
    C-->>M: 200 OK, status=APPROVED
